  "changes_html": "<h2>About This Vintage</h2><h2>Changes Since the Last Update</h2><p>Since the <a href=\"https://budgetlab.yale.edu/research/state-tariffs-july-11-2025\">July 11 report</a>:</p><ul><li>On July 12, President Trump announced 30% tariffs on the EU and Mexico, to go into effect August 1, up from prior 10% and 25% rates respectively.</li></ul><p>TBL analyzes tariffs on a &ldquo;real-time current policy&rdquo; basis, where policy as it stands as of date certain is assumed to continue in perpetuity, even if framed as a temporary policy.</p>",
